                <h1 class="text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-white mb-2">天福宮關懷據點</h1>
                <p class="text-amber-200 text-lg">讓長輩在熟悉的生活圈裡，重新連回人群、連回日常。</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="p-8 md:p-12 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-800 mb-6 border-l-4 border-amber-600 pl-4">我們做什麼</h3>
              <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4">
                 <div class="flex bg-stone-50 p-4 rounded-lg">
                    <div class="mr-4 mt-1 text-amber-600"><i data-lucide="heart" class="w-5 h-5"></i></div>
                    <div><h4 class="font-bold text-stone-800">健康促進</h4><p class="text-stone-600 text-sm">量測、運動、健康知識</p></div>
                 </div>
                 <div class="flex bg-stone-50 p-4 rounded-lg">
                    <div class="mr-4 mt-1 text-amber-600"><i data-lucide="users" class="w-5 h-5"></i></div>
                    <div><h4 class="font-bold text-stone-800">社會參與</h4><p class="text-stone-600 text-sm">共餐、手作、節慶活動</p></div>
                 </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-800 mb-6 border-l-4 border-amber-600 pl-4">聯絡與支持</h3>
              <p class="text-stone-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">歡迎社會大眾以捐款方式支持送餐與陪伴行動。</p>
              <div class="bg-amber-100/50 border border-amber-200 p-6 rounded-xl mb-6">
                <h4 class="font-bold text-amber-900 mb-2">據點基本資訊</h4>
                <p class="text-amber-800 text-sm">地址：苗栗縣西湖鄉金獅村2鄰金獅9號</p>
                <p class="text-amber-800 text-sm">電話：037-920208</p>
